# The checkpoint llm.html fetches from beside it. 378 MB — over
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so it is copied to the host out-of-band rather
# than committed. Rebuild it with:
#   cp ~/dev/llmoxide/models/Qwen3-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf weights.gguf
weights.gguf

# The checkpoint the llmoxide post's lab runs, 145 MB, also over the limit and
# also copied to the host out-of-band. Rebuild it with:
#   curl -L -o lab/SmolLM2-135M-Instruct-Q8_0.gguf \
#     https://huggingface.co/bartowski/SmolLM2-135M-Instruct-GGUF/resolve/main/SmolLM2-135M-Instruct-Q8_0.gguf
# The lab's .js and .wasm are tracked; ~/dev/llmoxide/scripts/build-lab.sh lab
# rebuilds them.
lab/*.gguf

.DS_Store

__pycache__/
